  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.8:\n- Added LockForUpdate() for pessimistic row locking in fluent SELECT queries\n- Supports PostgreSQL/MySQL FOR UPDATE and SQL Server update-lock table hints\n- SQLite reports unsupported locking by default, with explicit ignoreIfUnsupported opt-in\n- Fluent queries now honor ambient UnitOfWork/DbSession execution in Parallel mode\n\nv0.1.6:\n- Added enum comparison support in Where expressions\n- Added compound expressions (&& and ||) in single Where clause\n- Added null comparisons (== null → IS NULL, != null → IS NOT NULL)\n- Added negation support (!Contains → NOT LIKE, !Equals → <>)\n- Added list.Contains(x.Id) → IN clause support\n- Added !list.Contains(x.Id) → NOT IN clause support\n- Added ToLower()/ToUpper() → LOWER()/UPPER() SQL functions\n- Added Trim() → TRIM() SQL function\n- Added string.Length → LENGTH()/LEN()/CHAR_LENGTH() per dialect\n- Added Equals() method support\n- Added Equals(value, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) for case-insensitive comparison\n- Added chained method support: ToLower().Contains(), ToLower().Equals(), etc.",
